{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"502732e5dedde16e","x":-760,"y":-144,"width":474,"height":391,"type":"text","text":"## Map Node\n\nExtends Node2D\n\n**Each map node has a unique ID which must be set on creation. This is used for saving and storing data.**\n\nA circular display on the map. The player icon can travel to it via a map node path.\n\nWhen the player reaches it, a node card, if configured, will display."},
		{"id":"f3e9d6b8f45157a2","x":-1600,"y":73,"width":510,"height":467,"type":"text","text":"## Level Map\nAbstract class; extend for each map\n\nA 2D map used to group levels together. There will be a main map for the game, and additionally others should other areas be added (like a collection of challenge/unfinished levels, for instance)."},
		{"id":"f9342e1d94f52f70","x":-1545,"y":680,"width":400,"height":298,"type":"text","text":"## Player Icon\n\nExtends AnimatedSprite2D\n\nRepresents the player, and is used to traverse the map. 8x8 sprite, with a sword pointing toward the cursor. The closest map node path to the cursor is the path the player will travel upon clicking."},
		{"id":"370433d128365508","x":-165,"y":247,"width":671,"height":431,"type":"text","text":"## Level Card\nExtends resource\n\nButton functionality: opens level panel\n\nvar title:String\nvar description:String\nvar difficulty:Difficulty"},
		{"id":"f7d7c93035a40081","x":200,"y":880,"width":369,"height":271,"type":"text","text":"## Difficulty\nEnum\n\nEFFORTLESS,\nEASY,\nAVERAGE,\nHARD,\nTOUGH,\nINSANE"},
		{"id":"07bdf6a02ed1a35d","x":813,"y":463,"width":365,"height":271,"type":"text","text":"## Level Loader\nLoads a passed level with passed configuration data."},
		{"id":"05341d5c6e8f8f24","x":1520,"y":-25,"width":364,"height":282,"type":"text","text":"## Level Config\nVariable data about a level.\nContains the player's state, the selected modifiers, etc."},
		{"id":"05ebad15a35406e4","type":"text","text":"Load map","x":1121,"y":1045,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"7c689e0aa551e47c","x":660,"y":1028,"width":250,"height":95,"type":"text","text":"Update player data with lives, gold, etc."},
		{"id":"6b7cc2b8f86499d9","type":"text","text":"## Level Panel\nExtends Control\n\nTakes a level card and displays its information visually.\nAllows for configurable level settings and display information, as well as a play and exit button.\n\nContains method get_level_config, which pulls from the level Map and the exported data within the level card","x":686,"y":-99,"width":620,"height":431},
		{"id":"e6f53c9e91c201a1","x":-1584,"y":-460,"width":479,"height":340,"type":"text","text":"## Map Data\nSave data for a map. Stores level completion data, player state, and any other variable information.\n\nData saved:\n- Completed levels \n- Player's gold\n- Player's inventory (upgrades)\n- Node Events\n- Player's node location"},
		{"id":"00f20239381cd680","x":-585,"y":-840,"width":126,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Load level"},
		{"id":"1ea22969518f5f9a","x":-940,"y":-840,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Teleport / damage the player"},
		{"id":"9b2625ec60411416","type":"text","text":"Trigger Dialogue","x":-260,"y":-840,"width":126,"height":60},
		{"id":"b462c2050630501e","x":-742,"y":-605,"width":441,"height":290,"type":"text","text":"## Node Event\nA temporary event which exists on a map node.\n\nStores as a type, which is an enum in node event.\n\nHas methods for each map update, when a player runs into it, and functionality for each type.\n\n**NOTE:** Node events are stored in the map data, **not** in the node.\n"},
		{"id":"c6649edc5ffd963a","x":871,"y":850,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Level end"},
		{"id":"ba5a4081802e06ec","type":"text","text":"## Map Path Requirement\n\nAbstract extends resource\n\nHas a method, is_met(), which takes the mapdata and path and returns true if the requirement has been met.\n\nExtend as needed. Example requirements:\n- From is completed\n- From is completed via a secret exit\n- Player has a certain item equipped\n- \n","x":-760,"y":978,"width":474,"height":320},
		{"id":"8ec7168047d836cd","x":-760,"y":380,"width":474,"height":400,"type":"text","text":"## Map Node Path\n\nExtends line2d\n\n@export var from : MapNode\n@export var to : MapNode\n@export var requirements:Array\\[MapPathRequirement]\n\nA line connecting a map node to another.\n\nEach MapPathRequirement's is_met() method must return true upon map update for the path to be travelled. \n\nWhether or not it displays / is transparent depends upon other exports that will be created when the actual script is.\n"},
		{"id":"e2c107669d58e6d9","x":-60,"y":-339,"width":461,"height":391,"type":"text","text":"## Node Card\nExtends resource, abstract\n\nHas a button with configurable text and color.\nAbstract method for functionality after button is pressed.\n\nExample - level:\n\n\"The Depths\"\n\\[Info]\n\n(Pressing info would display a play button and info for the level)"}
	],
	"edges":[
